      "comment" : "Shown in the compare view where a photo couldn't be decoded for display.",
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "Pinned" : {
      "comment" : "Value of the Readout tile in the Quick Menu: the live camera readout is on and stays on screen in clean view. Short: it sits in a small tile.",
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "Pointing down, not level" : {
