    "VoiceOver says when each photo is saved and signed, or what went wrong." : {
      "comment" : "Accessibility screen: spoken feedback. VoiceOver is Apple's screen reader; keep the name unchanged.",
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "WB" : {
      "comment" : "Short label of the white balance control in the control grid.",
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "What's in This Photo" : {
      "comment" : "Title of the sheet that lists the facts read back from the photo nope. just saved: files, exposure, signature, details kept and removed.",
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "When Astro turns Night Mode on, it stays on after you leave Astro instead of turning off again." : {
      "comment" : "Explains the Keep Night Mode After Astro switch. Astro is the night sky drive mode; Night Mode is the name of nope.'s switch. Use their translations.",
