      "comment" : "Name of the rear wide (main) camera lens.",
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "With a hardware keyboard, the Space bar takes a photo." : {
      "comment" : "Accessibility screen: a connected keyboard's Space bar works as the shutter.",
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "Zero shutter lag" : {
      "comment" : "Live readout: the camera feature that takes the photo from frames buffered before the press.",
